      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "Inclusion criteria of studies were randomized controlled trials (RCT), non-randomized clinical trials, or observational studies with a concurrent control that investigated the efficacy and/or safety of JAK inhibitor treatment in patients with COVID-19, with no limitations on publication status or language. Exclusion criteria were (I) study designs other than the ones mentioned above; (II) meeting abstracts and articles with no full texts available; and (III) studies not providing sufficient information to be included in the systematic review.",
      "reason": "The manuscript explicitly specifies the inclusion criteria (study designs, population, intervention) and exclusion criteria."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "with no limitations on publication status or language.",
      "reason": "The manuscript specifies that there were no limitations on publication status or language."
